{"type":"research","references":[{"note":"A courtyard of a Hanoi tube house with low stools, a charcoal stove, and a big pot; the pot and fire set the scene for cooking bánh chưng.","url":"https://thietkehoanggia.com/en/house-interior-design/the-modern-3storey-tube-house-interior-design-in-hanoi.html","title":"The modern 3-storey tube house interior design in Hanoi","use":"set"},{"note":"The family front room with an ancestor altar; the altar is not drawn, but a small wooden table appears in the final shot where the wrapped bánh chưng sits.","url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DSbSCcDE408?hl=en","title":"Instagram","use":"set"},{"note":"Rooftop of Hanoi’s Old Quarter during New Year’s Eve fireworks; midnight lighting and fireworks backdrop.","url":"https://www.archdaily.com/956220/tube-houses-15-projects-reinterpreting-the-narrow-vietnamese-residences","title":"Tube Houses: 15 Projects Reinterpreting the Narrow Vietnamese Residences  | ArchDaily","use":"set"},{"note":"Ancestor altar placement: central wall of the main room, eye‑level or higher, never below waist height, facing the entrance.","url":"https://www.vietnamtourism.com/en/ancestor-worship-in-vietnam-altars-rituals-and-what-travelers-should-know","title":"Ancestor worship in Vietnam: altars, rituals and what travelers should know | Vietnam Tourism","use":"customs"},{"note":"Bánh chưng: flat square parcel wrapped in glossy green dong leaves with visible leaf veins, tied with four thin pale bamboo strings in a grid (no ribbon or bow), darker green leaf fold at corners.","url":"https://parfumdautomne.fr/en/ancestor-worship-in-vietnam","title":"Ancestor Worship in Vietnam: When the Dead Remain Among the Living","use":"props"},{"note":"Cooking scene: pot of boiling bánh chưng on a charcoal stove in the courtyard at night; the pot and fire set the cooking atmosphere.","url":"https://thietkehoanggia.com/en/house-interior-design/the-modern-3storey-tube-house-interior-design-in-hanoi.html","title":"The modern 3-storey tube house interior design in Hanoi","use":"costume"}]}
